3/jour — &lt;i&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Image-Miroir.html&quot; title=&quot;Image miroir&quot;&gt;image miroir&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Modification-Dapparence.html&quot; title=&quot;Modification d&amp;#39;apparence&quot;&gt;modification d&#39;apparence&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
